    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506630/extras/6f98df26c00e2050cb70c8148ead35f8.avif?t=1739885511\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thin Threads</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that explores how a financially struggling family\u2019s life turns into a nightmare in just one night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this experience, you will step into the shoes of each family member, witnessing the story unfold from their perspectives, immersing you in a truly terrifying scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delves into the hardships of living in extreme poverty, presenting brutal and spine-chilling moments that will leave you afraid to sleep alone after playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed our previous game, <i>Silent Still</i>, you\u2019ll likely love this one too.<br><br> <br><strong>Gameplay:</strong>\u00a030 - 50 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506630/extras/8a5e5f1f4f84b4cb55ab0f08e7f0f6f6.avif?t=1739885511\" width=600 height=156 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Feature:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Photorealistic Graphics<br>- High Quality 3D audio<br>- Deep Atmosphere<br>- Intriguing Story<br>- Realistic Gameplay</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506630/extras/6f98df26c00e2050cb70c8148ead35f8.avif?t=1739885511\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thin Threads</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that explores how a financially struggling family\u2019s life turns into a nightmare in just one night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this experience, you will step into the shoes of each family member, witnessing the story unfold from their perspectives, immersing you in a truly terrifying scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delves into the hardships of living in extreme poverty, presenting brutal and spine-chilling moments that will leave you afraid to sleep alone after playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed our previous game, <i>Silent Still</i>, you\u2019ll likely love this one too.<br><br> <br><strong>Gameplay:</strong>\u00a030 - 50 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506630/extras/8a5e5f1f4f84b4cb55ab0f08e7f0f6f6.avif?t=1739885511\" width=600 height=156 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Feature:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Photorealistic Graphics<br>- High Quality 3D audio<br>- Deep Atmosphere<br>- Intriguing Story<br>- Realistic Gameplay</p>",
